                <AbstractText Label="CONCLUSION" NlmCategory="CONCLUSIONS">Rab GTPases required for cell surface expression and signal transduction of CXCR4 or CCR2 differ from those required for the CXCR4/CCR2 heterodimer. Determining trafficking regulators of two key receptors involved in the metastatic transition may identify new targets to restrict expression of chemokine receptors employed during metastasis.</AbstractText>
